{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "%lld 件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld packets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件 · 平均間隔 %@ 秒 · 最短 %@ 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld packets · mean interval %@ s · shortest %@ s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 番": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 番を記録しました（%@向き）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recorded No. %lld (facing %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 秒前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld s ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aoshingo のライセンス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo’s License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aoshingo の高度化PICS アドバタイズ解析は、yumu19/ble-pics-viewer（MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Tsubasa Yumura）の解析仕様と実装を参考に、Swift で再実装したものです。受信方法と解析結果を公開してくださった作者に心より感謝します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo’s decoding of Advanced PICS advertisements is a Swift reimplementation based on the format and implementation of yumu19/ble-pics-viewer (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Tsubasa Yumura). Our heartfelt thanks to the author for publishing how to receive and decode them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aoshingo は、高度化PICS に対応した交差点の信号機が発信する Bluetooth 信号を受信して、歩行者用信号の状態を表示する非公式アプリです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo is an unofficial app that receives the Bluetooth broadcasts of traffic signals at intersections equipped with Advanced PICS and shows the state of the pedestrian signals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aoshingo は非公式アプリです。警察庁、信号機メーカー、信GO! とは関係ありません。受信専用で、信号機に送信することはありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo is an unofficial app, not affiliated with the National Police Agency, signal manufacturers or Shingo!. It only receives and never transmits to traffic signals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aoshingo へようこそ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to Aoshingo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth Low Energy に対応した端末が必要です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A device with Bluetooth Low Energy is required."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth がオフです": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth Is Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth の使用が許可されていません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth Access Not Allowed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PICS 以外のメーカーデータ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manufacturer data not from PICS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Service UUID が「なし」の場合、iOS のバックグラウンドでは受信できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If there is no Service UUID, iOS cannot receive these signals in the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type %lld が短すぎます（%lld / %lld バイト）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type %lld too short (%lld / %lld bytes)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type %lld の最新パケット": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latest Type %lld packet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceOver": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceOver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「残り目安」は 8 段階の目安で、秒数ではありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Remaining” is a rough 8-step guide, not a number of seconds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「現地確認」欄で印を付けたときは、その印（信号の番号と端末の向き）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Labels you add in the Field Check section (the signal number and the direction your device faces)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとから設定画面でいつでも変更できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can change this at any time in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの現在地（緯度・経度）、機種、OS のバージョン、言語、広告 ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your location (latitude and longitude), device model, OS version, language, or advertising ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いま向いている方向の横断歩道を、この番号の信号として記録します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the crosswalk you are facing as this signal number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おおまかな方向と距離を求めるために位置情報の許可を、歩いているか車などに乗っているかを見分けるために「モーションとフィットネス」の許可をお願いすることがあります。位置そのものは端末の外に出ませんが、方向と距離を合わせると、交差点のまわり数十 m のどのあたりにいたかは分かります。同じ送信用トークン（最長 6 時間有効）で送ったデータは、サーバーが受け取るときに同じ端末からのものと分かります。サーバーはトークンを実測データと一緒には保存しません。生データは 90 日後に削除し、交差点ごとの集計だけを残します。送信したデータには識別子がないため、あとから個別に削除することはできません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo may ask for location access to work out the rough direction and distance, and for Motion & Fitness access to tell whether you are walking or in a vehicle. Your location itself never leaves the device, but together the direction and distance show roughly where you were within a few dozen metres of the intersection. Data sent with the same upload token (valid for up to 6 hours) can be recognised by the server as coming from the same device when it arrives; the server does not store the token with the field data. Raw data is deleted after 90 days and only per-intersection totals are kept. Because sent data carries no identifier, it cannot be deleted individually later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このビルドには送信先が設定されていないため、実測データを提供できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no server configured, so field data cannot be shared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この交差点の信号データには使用中の信号がありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signal data of this intersection contains no signals in use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末では App Attest を使えないため送信できません（シミュレーターなど）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device cannot use App Attest, so nothing can be sent (for example, the Simulator)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末では受信できません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Device Cannot Receive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これは開発中の試験版（pre-alpha）です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an early test version (pre-alpha)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべての信号の青点滅・赤を読み上げる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Announce Flashing Green and Red for All Signals"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その他": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どのモードでも、色だけでなく形と文字で信号を示します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every mode shows the signal with shapes and words, not color alone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オフにすると、まだ送信していないデータはすぐに削除されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning this off immediately deletes data that has not been sent yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オンにすると、表示中の交差点のどの信号でも、青点滅・赤・信号なしに変わったときと受信が途切れたときに、VoiceOver のフォーカスの位置にかかわらず読み上げます。青に変わったことは、フォーカスしている信号だけ読み上げます。オフにすると、フォーカスしている信号の変化だけを読み上げます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, VoiceOver announces any signal of the shown intersection that changes to flashing green, red or no signal, and any break in reception, wherever the focus is. A change to green is announced only for the focused signal. When off, only changes of the focused signal are announced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カラーユニバーサルデザイン推奨配色の青と朱色。色の見え方の違いがあっても区別しやすい組み合わせです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blue and vermilion from the Color Universal Design recommended palette, easy to tell apart across color vision differences."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コントロールセンターまたは設定で Bluetooth をオンにしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Bluetooth in Control Center or Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "サーバーは IP アドレスを記録しません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server does not record IP addresses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ソースコードとライセンス全文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source Code and Full License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ソースコード（GitHub）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source Code (GitHub)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デモを表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デモ表示中：実際の信号ではありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo: this is not a real signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バージョン": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プライバシーポリシー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy Policy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ヘッダーが短すぎます（%lld バイト）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Header too short (%lld bytes)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "モノクロ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monochrome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ローカル名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不明": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unknown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不明。実際の信号を確認してください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unknown. Check the actual signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不正防止のための鍵の ID（インストールごとに 1 つ）。鍵の登録と送信用トークンの取得のときだけ送り、実測データとは結び付けません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A key ID for fraud prevention (one per installation). It is sent only to register the key and to get an upload token, and is never linked to the field data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交差点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intersections"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交差点 ID %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intersection ID %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交差点から見たあなたの方向と距離、端末の向き、歩く向きと速さ（どれもおおまかな区分）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your direction and distance from the intersection, the direction your device faces, and your walking direction and speed (all as rough categories)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交差点の情報": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intersection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐ送信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号なし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号なし。実際の信号を確認してください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No signal. Check the actual signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号の周期や、どの番号がどの横断歩道かを調べるため、受信したデータの提供にご協力いただけますか。協力しなくても、すべての機能をそのまま使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To learn signal cycles and which number belongs to which crossing, would you share the data you receive? Every feature works the same if you do not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号の番号がどの横断歩道かは、まだ確認できていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which crossing each signal number belongs to has not been confirmed yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号や「残り目安」が変わった時刻（秒単位）と、それぞれが続いた時間（0.1 秒単位）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When signals and the remaining-time indication changed (to the second), and how long each lasted (to 0.1 s)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号を探しています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking for Signals"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号データ受信中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Receiving signal data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号データ受信中 · %lld 秒前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Receiving signal data · %lld s ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号情報をまだ受信していません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No signal data received yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
